{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05仅停留18秒，却同时铺开较多感受词和叙事信息，瞬时扫读压力明显高于X；X的双栏主叙事更稳定。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键句有视觉落点，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样反应；感受词又通过大小层级和音乐时点分批出现，比X静态堆在右侧更容易与正在听到的音乐对应。更重要的是，Y把从害怕暴露需要、逐渐确认亲近、担心失去，到最终不再隐藏喜欢的心理变化串得比较清楚，水波、呼吸、声音、光线等感受也更具体细腻；虽然个别段落偏满，但整体观看体验更完整。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a4d6b2a9-62f3-4a20-8cc4-ffff322bc4f1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T044933843868Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:50:43.786477+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "75e707decf6f3dd86c3b2ba0623e6a3e4f8ac9c97dfdd26c456636436975a188", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach